=== SECTION G — structural lemma battery (exhaustive to 4x4) ===
  The premises ADR-0006's soundness argument rests on, checked
  exactly per position with no search. Columns are VIOLATIONS.
  L1 fill legal for mover | L2 area score invariant | L3 opponent
  play is suicide | L4 fill captures nothing | L7 fill creates no
  new unconditional life for the mover | L8 ...nor the opponent.

