=== SECTION H — retrograde table as a SOUND no-prune control ===
  The retrograde value iteration (ADR-0009 Decision 3) uses the FULL
  legal move set. On slots that are not KO_SENSITIVE its stored value
  is an exact unpruned fresh-start score. Comparing the eye-pruned
  forward search against those slots is the sound ADR-0006 test --
  the standing test of ADR-0009:118-123, actually executed.

